tabs: File Write Edit Revision Production Collaboration View [Preview]
## Zoom
  L Fit icon=foreground_view-fullscreen.svg (checked) name=Fit Width
  S 100% icon=foreground_view-zoom-fit.svg name=Actual Size
  S Zoom In icon=foreground_view-zoom-in.svg name=Zoom In
  S Zoom Out icon=foreground_view-zoom-out.svg name=Zoom Out
## Pages
  S Previous icon=foreground_arrow-back.svg name=Previous Page
  S Next icon=foreground_arrow-forward.svg name=Next Page
## Output
  L Save PDF icon=foreground_document-save.svg name=Save PDF…
  S Open in Viewer icon=foreground_file-application.svg name=Open in Viewer
## Setup
  L Letter icon=foreground_document.svg name=Page Setup…: Screenplay · Letter (the format's) · title page.
## Refresh
  L Refresh icon=foreground_view-refresh.svg name=Refresh (F5)
  S Follow Edits icon=foreground_visibility.svg (checked) name=Follow Edits
## Close
  L Close Preview icon=foreground_cancel.svg name=Close Preview
